the chance or the probability that the coin&nbsp;
was a head? On the situation she is in at that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:13.260
moment of having been woken up. So Sleeping Beauty&nbsp;
has woken up on a Monday or a Tuesday, she has no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:17.880
idea, she has nothing that can help her figure&nbsp;
out which day it is, there's no secret clock or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:22.200
