00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:26.940
when we are woken up and asked this question,&nbsp;
having assumed that it was the tails in our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:31.980
own head, we are like okay this could be either&nbsp;
Monday or Tuesday and they are equally likely,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:37.920
there's nothing to distinguish between those cases.&nbsp;
So we can say the probability of it being a Monday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:44.280
given it was tails because we assumed it was tails,&nbsp;
